# kaze

--- Geisha_abi | attack | TID_GEISHA_WEAPON_DESC
raw  Kaze dashes a short distance and strikes the nearest target. Kaze has a 'Strike Spot' at a fixed angle around herself.\nHitting an enemy in a Strike Spot deals <VALUE1>% damage and resets the Strike Spot to a new position.
now  Kaze dashes a short distance and strikes the nearest target. Kaze has a 'Strike Spot' at a fixed angle around herself.\nHitting an enemy in a Strike Spot deals <VALUE1>% damage and resets the Strike Spot to a new position.
  VALUE1  -  -> 200

